BACKGROUND
----------------------------------------------------------------------

A major financial institution has accumulated more than 10 years of operational history and governance data.

The organisation is considering whether AI and Large Reasoning Models (including embedding models) can be used to derive enterprise-level insights that cannot be obtained through conventional reporting, dashboards, controls testing, risk assessments, audits or manual analysis.

The goal is not incremental improvement.

The goal is to identify a genuinely valuable and differentiated capability.

