DATA CHARACTERISTICS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Strengths:

- Rich text exists across almost all object types.
- More than 10 years of history.
- Large volume of incidents.
- Large volume of remediation actions.
- Large volume of governance information.

Constraints:

- LLM context windows are limited.
- Entire datasets cannot be placed into context.
- Traditional governance relationships may be imperfect.
- Product data may require extraction from text.
- Not every object will be perfectly linked.

